The '''Boo Boo barn'''<ref name="Empire Day">{{Rebels|Empire Day (episode)}}</ref> was a [[farm]] located on the [[planet]] [[Lothal]]. Its residents were once attacked by rabid [[Loth-cat]]s,<ref name="Trivia Gallery">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/empire-day-trivia-gallery|text="Empire Day" Trivia Gallery - Star Wars Rebels}} {{C|Slide 5}}</ref> which made headlines on the [[planet]] during the fifteenth [[Empire Day|anniversary]] of the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Empire Day" />

